{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5fcae4c837e90f92c7ef6037b08f7bc0.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5fcae4c837e90f92c7ef6037b08f7bc0.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5fcae4c837e90f92c7ef6037b08f7bc0.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sonak</strong>\u00a0is a third person fantasy Action RPG, where character creation comes with endless possibilities. Instead of complicated skill trees and hours of planning, live in the moment and evolve your character and abilities with every level.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and level up 10 distinct abilities such as spears, storms, or spinning tornados.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master an Element</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire, Poison, Frost, Earth, Air, Lightning \u2014 each unlocks unique relics and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your offensive, defensive, or utility secondary abilities to shape your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/975446dd3039d42938570369ff14fe99.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/37c10557d34c3a11585418beffdeca97.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/37c10557d34c3a11585418beffdeca97.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/37c10557d34c3a11585418beffdeca97.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you\u2019ll unlock fresh opportunities and meaningful choices. Every character will have different options, so think on your feet and follow your instincts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up Differently</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of three permanent upgrades instead of a traditional skill tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character and primary ability level separately for deeper build customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades permanently change skills \u2014 exploding slashes, orbiting projectiles, stationary storms, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/1a2c3bd80b9b69cd9f211cd1db5ed906.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/4301ec39acd902c5a38b70d0f8aaf9cb.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/4301ec39acd902c5a38b70d0f8aaf9cb.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/4301ec39acd902c5a38b70d0f8aaf9cb.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, craft, and forge your way to greatness as every item becomes a stepping stone to the ultimate build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Build Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Random modifiers like bonus spell damage, added health, or increased critical strike chance ensure every piece of gear customizes your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Destiny</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Anvil to re-roll stats, add new modifiers, or double the strength of existing ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt gear down in the Forge to extract  modifiers, then carefully apply them at the Anvil, where every decision can redefine your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/bfb7af8c14a66cbc11c80f3bc905eed5.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/8f84c8ce35e87d7c8b2fa8454e431b80.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/8f84c8ce35e87d7c8b2fa8454e431b80.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While adventures in Sonak overflow with monsters and loot, they also hide a rare purple portal leading to a bonus challenge zone brimming with extra rewards. Step through, and you\u2019ll face one of many trials.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Swarm</strong><br>An ever-escalating horde of monsters tests your speed and efficiency. The faster you slay your enemies, the stronger they become and the greater the loot they drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gauntlet</strong><br>Battle through ten increasingly difficult waves of foes, with the option to cash out after each round. Push on to claim the ultimate prize, or retreat early to bank your current haul, the choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behemoth</strong><br>Design a mini-boss by choosing its modifiers. The more enhancements you enable, the deadlier it becomes and the richer the rewards for defeating it. But beware: a fully decked-out mini-boss surpasses any challenge you\u2019ll face in a standard adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5d20cf7eaaa3617f8503102c113d62b3.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/ad2cafc5afca51482d66a0316c2c11ef.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/ad2cafc5afca51482d66a0316c2c11ef.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/ad2cafc5afca51482d66a0316c2c11ef.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-evolving bosses and ultimate pinnacle encounters that guard the rarest loot and unlock new paths for your journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure ends with a climactic boss fight where you never know what to expect. Storms chase you, floors explode, enemies overwhelm you, new mechanics stack together for endlessly unique encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Loot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is the only way to keep rare and valuable gear, if you are defeated in battle, those treasures are lost forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinnacle Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate challenges at key milestones, testing your skill against Sonak\u2019s most fearsome pinnacle bosses!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528860?t=1758516273","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/3d0399504f606128dd7ec9459e20acfd5acc8906/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758516273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/0ba84e73d46afcc9b02c242b11352779da8341a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758516273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/0ba84e73d46afcc9b02c242b11352779da8341a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758516273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5fcae4c837e90f92c7ef6037b08f7bc0.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5fcae4c837e90f92c7ef6037b08f7bc0.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5fcae4c837e90f92c7ef6037b08f7bc0.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sonak</strong>\u00a0is a third person fantasy Action RPG, where character creation comes with endless possibilities. Instead of complicated skill trees and hours of planning, live in the moment and evolve your character and abilities with every level.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Own Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and level up 10 distinct abilities such as spears, storms, or spinning tornados.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master an Element</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire, Poison, Frost, Earth, Air, Lightning \u2014 each unlocks unique relics and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your offensive, defensive, or utility secondary abilities to shape your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/975446dd3039d42938570369ff14fe99.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/37c10557d34c3a11585418beffdeca97.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/37c10557d34c3a11585418beffdeca97.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/37c10557d34c3a11585418beffdeca97.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you\u2019ll unlock fresh opportunities and meaningful choices. Every character will have different options, so think on your feet and follow your instincts.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up Differently</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of three permanent upgrades instead of a traditional skill tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character and primary ability level separately for deeper build customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades permanently change skills \u2014 exploding slashes, orbiting projectiles, stationary storms, and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/1a2c3bd80b9b69cd9f211cd1db5ed906.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/4301ec39acd902c5a38b70d0f8aaf9cb.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/4301ec39acd902c5a38b70d0f8aaf9cb.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/4301ec39acd902c5a38b70d0f8aaf9cb.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, craft, and forge your way to greatness as every item becomes a stepping stone to the ultimate build.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Build Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Random modifiers like bonus spell damage, added health, or increased critical strike chance ensure every piece of gear customizes your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Destiny</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Anvil to re-roll stats, add new modifiers, or double the strength of existing ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Mastery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt gear down in the Forge to extract  modifiers, then carefully apply them at the Anvil, where every decision can redefine your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/bfb7af8c14a66cbc11c80f3bc905eed5.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/8f84c8ce35e87d7c8b2fa8454e431b80.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/8f84c8ce35e87d7c8b2fa8454e431b80.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While adventures in Sonak overflow with monsters and loot, they also hide a rare purple portal leading to a bonus challenge zone brimming with extra rewards. Step through, and you\u2019ll face one of many trials.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Swarm</strong><br>An ever-escalating horde of monsters tests your speed and efficiency. The faster you slay your enemies, the stronger they become and the greater the loot they drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gauntlet</strong><br>Battle through ten increasingly difficult waves of foes, with the option to cash out after each round. Push on to claim the ultimate prize, or retreat early to bank your current haul, the choice is yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Behemoth</strong><br>Design a mini-boss by choosing its modifiers. The more enhancements you enable, the deadlier it becomes and the richer the rewards for defeating it. But beware: a fully decked-out mini-boss surpasses any challenge you\u2019ll face in a standard adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/5d20cf7eaaa3617f8503102c113d62b3.avif?t=1758516273\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/ad2cafc5afca51482d66a0316c2c11ef.poster.avif?t=1758516273\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/ad2cafc5afca51482d66a0316c2c11ef.webm?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/extras/ad2cafc5afca51482d66a0316c2c11ef.mp4?t=1758516273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face ever-evolving bosses and ultimate pinnacle encounters that guard the rarest loot and unlock new paths for your journey.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure ends with a climactic boss fight where you never know what to expect. Storms chase you, floors explode, enemies overwhelm you, new mechanics stack together for endlessly unique encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Stakes Loot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is the only way to keep rare and valuable gear, if you are defeated in battle, those treasures are lost forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pinnacle Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock ultimate challenges at key milestones, testing your skill against Sonak\u2019s most fearsome pinnacle bosses!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sublime Orange LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528860/6714d75da11cb2163c45fd91b